/v1/","context":{"app_id":4494830,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1846651706691122","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Launch Stream!","summary":"The dev is playing The Vaults Below Durn: A Field Study. Drop in and ask any questions you want or give it a try yourself!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:35:24Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691122","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1846651706687199","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"announcement","title":"Extra Accessibility Settings For Steam Next Fest","summary":"We've added a few extra accessibility settings prior to Next Fest!Game Accessibility Nexus provided some recommendations on how we can further improve the accessibility of The Vaults Below Durn: A Field Study. Many we've been able to implement for the demo such as:Toggle in the settings to make the wet patches more visibleVSync ControlUser contrast adjustmentFine tuning the Long Press durationMore accessible font optionsAll this is in addition to the accessibility features the demo already has:N","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:10:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687199","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1846018067933480","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"update","title":"Major Update for Steam Next Fest!","summary":"It's been a busy year! Major update for The Vaults Below Durn: A Field Study going into Next Fest!Fully Voice ActedEvery note is narrated by professional voice actors who have brought the characters to life. On top of this being a massive boon for the game's immersion, it also supports our commitment to accessibility. On top of the narration, there are also subtitles which down the line we can update to support more languages.Note ArchiveEvery note you find is now stored in your Note Archive whi","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:23:55Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933480","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1835236783560813","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"update","title":"Steam Achievements Update","summary":"Grab your Steam Achievements!If you haven't tried the demo yet, or even if you have, jump in and grab your Steam achievements. There are two Steam Achievements to find in the demo, and many more to come in the full release.New FeatureThe listen mechanic has been reworked so it is now proximity based, instead of having the player toggle it on and off. The audio clue's volume has also been increased. Performance EnhancementsTextures have been optimized to improve performance, and the \"Low\" Quality","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-11T15:38:21Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835236783560813","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1833968530894050","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"update","title":"Gamayo Update","summary":"We had a great time exhibiting the demo for The Vaults Below Durn: A Field Study at Gamayo! It was great to watch people play the game for the first time, and we even got to try out some awesome games ourselves. The players provided some great feedback.Many said the tentacle grab was lacklustre. Many people were confused about what counted as a clue and what wasn't. Opinions on the sound design was mixed so that will require more work.Everyone loved the aesthetic even more than we expected which","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-30T18:25:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833968530894050","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4494830-1833334318566234","game_id":"steam-4494830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Vaults Below Durn Demo is LIVE!","summary":"Greetings, Explorers!🚪 The gates are finally open. The Vaults Below Durn: A Field Study Demo is officially live and free to play on Steam right now!Step into the depths. Your task is simple but perilous: navigate the dungeon using nothing but your own wits and the ominous notes left by the previous explorer.👁️ What to expect in the Demo:The First Five Rooms: Including the first two clue variations. Expect to find more clues, and dealing with combinations of clues in the full release.The Core Ded","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-20T13:03:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318566234","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4494830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:29Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:28Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4494830":"2026-10-26T02:33:29Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4494830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:28Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:28Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4743100":{"l